{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27318","headline":"鸟散余花落 · 赵存约","name":"鸟散余花落","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春晓游禽集，幽庭几树花。\n坐来惊艳色，飞去堕晴霞。\n翅拂繁枝落，风添舞影斜。\n彩云飘玉砌，绦雪下仙家。\n分散音初静，凋零蘂带葩。\n空阶瞻翫久，应共惜年华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵存约","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}